msgid ""
"KFloppy is a utility that provides a straightforward graphical means to "
"format 3.5\" and 5.25\" floppy disks."
msgstr ""
"KFloppy adalah utilitas yang menyediakan cara grafis langsung untuk "
"memformat disk floppy 3.5 \"dan 5.25 \"."
